  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Can Tho Urban Development and Resilience Single Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Trust Fund is to reduce flood risk in the urban core area and improve connectivity between the city center and the new low risk urban growth areas, and enhance the capacity of city authorities to manage disaster risk in Can Tho City.</narrative>
  </description>
